<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <%- include('../partials/header.ejs') %>
        <title>GTIA | Transitioning to Tech</title>
        <link href="../../assets/sun/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet" />
        <link href="../../assets/sun/css/resources.css" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('../partials/navbar.ejs', { currentPage: 'transitioning' }) %>

        <div class="container py-5" id="transitioning">
            <h1 class="text-center">Transitioning to Tech</h1>

            <section class="pt-3">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">What are the immigration status requirements to come
                            to
                            Tech?
                        </h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            When enrolling to Tech as an international student, you will be under the F-1
                            visa,
                            with
                            certain credit and GPA requirements to maintain the visa status. For more
                            information
                            and assistance, visit the <a href="https://oie.gatech.edu/content/applying-f-1j-1-visa"
                                target="_blank" class="color-primary">OIE website</a> and/ or schedule an
                            appointment with the OIE counselor.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row pt-5">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">Is Georgia Tech's campus safe?</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            "Georgia Tech has an on-campus police department (GTPD - 404.894.2500) that
                            patrols
                            the
                            campus 24/7 and manages all campus safety. For more information, visit <a
                                href="https://studentlife.gatech.edu/content/campus-safety" target="_blank"
                                class="color-primary">Georgia Tech's campus safety website</a>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary ">
                            It's important to note that while the inside of campus is safe, it's not
                            recommended
                            to
                            leave campus at night without a group."
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row pt-5">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">What financial resources are available to
                            international
                            students?</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            Georgia Tech, like most U.S. schools, does not officially provide need-based
                            financial
                            aid for international students. However, there are many resources that students
                            can
                            take
                            advantage of based on their own circumstances. The complete list of resources
                            can be
                            found <a href="https://oie.gatech.edu/content/financial-assistance-international-students"
                                target="_blank" class="color-primary">here</a>.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row pt-5">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">Do I need a Social Security number (SSN) as an
                            international
                            student?</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            Under the F-1 visa, international students can seek on-campus, part-time
                            employment
                            opportunities (outside of OPT/CPT). If you are employed on-campus, you need to
                            request a
                            SSN. If you are not employed, then you are not eligible to request a SSN and
                            therefore
                            don't need one.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row pt-5">
                    <div class="pl-5">
                        <h3 class="color-dark-primary">How do I get around campus? (transportation)</h3>
                        <p class="color-dark-secondary pt-3">
                            Georgia Tech has multiple means of transportation that are safe and convenient.
                            The
                            campus bus operates routes not only around campus, but also to off-campus sites
                            (e.g.
                            the weekend grocery route). The Stingerette Safety Shuttle operates during the
                            night
                            for
                            on- demand pick-up and drop-off rideshare services and can be accessed via
                            smartphone
                            app or phone at (404) 385-7275. Students with ODS authorization can also use the
                            Student
                            Paratransit services.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>


        </div>

        <%- include('../partials/footer.ejs') %>
</body>

</html>